<PageTitle>University Course Catalog</PageTitle>

<h1>University Course Catalog</h1>
<p class="lead">Browse courses, explore departments, and enroll for the upcoming semester.</p>

<section class="mb-5">
    <h2>Featured Courses</h2>
    <div class="row">
